    <blockquote cite="https://example.test/source">
      <p>Quoted text contains <q>an inner quotation</q> and an abbreviation such as <abbr title="HyperText Markup Language">HTML</abbr>.</p>
    </blockquote>
    <p>
      Chemical notation: H<sub>2</sub>O; mathematical notation: x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>.
      Keyboard input: <kbd>Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>S</kbd>.
    </p>
    <pre><code>function greet(name) {
  return `Hello, ${name}`;
}</code></pre>
    <p>
      A variable is <var>n</var>, output is <samp>42</samp>, and deleted text is
      <del datetime="2026-01-01">removed</del> while <ins cite="https://example.test/edit">new</ins> text remains.
    </p>
    <footer>
      <p><cite>Collected Notes</cite> — <time datetime="2026-10-08">2026</time></p>
